  introLine: '"Hey! Are we still going on our date? I''m heading towards your home,
    is that alright?"'
  options:
  - text: '>"''Course, darlin'', come right in. I''ll be right there!"'
    type: 0
    resultText: '"Yay! But do hurry, I'''
  - text: '>"I''m not sure, think I''m gonna be a bit late. Twenty minutes, tops!"'
    type: 1
    resultText: '"Oh, okay. No problem. Just- hey, do I hear shooting? Hello?"'
  - text: '>"Can''t, sorry, I''m killin'' folks right now."'
    type: 2
    resultText: '"What?! How could you? I had no idea you were such a darn scoundrel!
      I think I need to be alone for a while."'
